      "english": "After he'd spent time in the monastery living his life through Christ's virtues, i.e., humility, meekness, renunciation, and the rest of the virtues resembling these, the abbot—a quiet and peaceful man—passed away in that monastery, with someone else appointed in his stead. Then, disorder arose amongst the monastery's congregation, for this reason:",
